DISCOVERY DEMAND A — GUARDIAN AD LITEM FILE

CASE: 1FDV-23-0001009
TO: Scot Stuart Brower, Esq. (Mother's Counsel)

DEFENDANT DEMANDS complete production of the Guardian Ad Litem file(s) for [Child Name], including but not limited to:

1. All GAL reports and observations (written and electronic)
2. All GAL communications (emails, calls, meetings, notes)
3. All GAL billing and fee statements
4. All underlying factual investigation materials
5. All GAL contacts with the mother, child, and third parties
6. GAL's methodology, assessment tools, and scoring rubrics
7. Dates, times, locations of all GAL observations and meetings

RESPONSE DUE: 14 calendar days from service
FORMAT: Native electronic file format

STATUTORY BASIS: HRS §571-46(b) mandates GAL independence and full disclosure of investigation.

Note: Failure to produce documents without legal justification constitutes a violation of discovery rules and grounds for sanctions under HRS §587-10.
